@startuml AD_HandleVehicleFailure
title UC-I02 + FR-NI-02/07 - Handle Vehicle Failure
|System / Controller|
start
:Receive Student report or valid fault telemetry;
|Database|
:Create or update one open incident;
:Restrict vehicle from new allocation;
:Flag affected redistribution order AtRisk;
|Operator|
:Open incident ticket;
|System / Controller|
:Check authorization and retrieve evidence;
if (Ticket and vehicle found?) then (yes)
  |Operator|
  :Investigate cause and impact;
  |System / Controller|
  fork
    |Database|
    :Read affected reservations and active rental;
  fork again
    |Database|
    :Read latest vehicle condition and fault evidence;
  end fork
  |Operator|
  :Record response for affected commitments;
  :Record corrective action and repair progress;
  |Database|
  :Save actions and incident status;
  |System / Controller|
  if (Repair complete and evidence valid?) then (yes)
    |Operator|
    :Request restoration;
    |System / Controller|
    :Check no unresolved fault or conflicting commitment;
    if (Safe to restore?) then (yes)
      |Database|
      :Atomically mark incident Resolved and restore eligibility;
      |Operator|
      :Review resolution and close ticket;
    else (no)
      |System / Controller|
      :Keep vehicle restricted and explain reason;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Keep ticket open and vehicle restricted;
  endif
else (no)
  :Show unavailable information; change no state;
endif
stop
@enduml
